Let vectors v_1, v_2, ..., v_198 in R^5 satisfy sum_{k=1}^198 v_k = 0 and sum_{k=1}^198 ||v_k||^2 = 90. Determine the minimum possible value of max_{1 <= i < j <= n} ||v_i - v_j||. You may assume n is a multiple of (p+1).

After solving the above problem, please output your final answer in the following format:
### The final answer is: \boxed{<your answer>}

